<title>USA: Imperial Credit ups dividend to $0.60/shr.</title>
<headline>Imperial Credit ups dividend to $0.60/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA HEIGHTS, Calif 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Credit Mortgage Holdings Inc said its board declared a second quarter dividend of $0.60 per share, payable on July 17, 1997 to stockholders of record on July 7, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said that this represents a 3.4 percent increase from the most recent quarter.</p>
